&lt;p&gt;If you are a nurse leader who is passionate about pediatrics, clinical excellence, and developing others, this could be the next step in your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire, and support nurses to deliver exceptional pediatric home care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct client assessments and supervisory visits throughout Middlesex County&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, review, and oversee individualized care plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clinical oversight and support for RNs and LPNs in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate orientation for newly hired staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete skills validations and competency assessments for new and tenured employees&lt;/li&gt;
