&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Registered Nurse (RN) license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years of RN experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior supervisory or leadership experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home care experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trach and vent experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for pediatric care and supporting clinical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
