&lt;li&gt;Occasional travel for site visits, meetings, and community engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in on-call rotation as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love BAYADA &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a mission-driven service line focused on helping clients age in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a supportive, values-based nonprofit organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build meaningful relationships with clients, families, and caregivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access ongoing training, mentorship, and career growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
