&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As a Home Health Nurse Manager your day may look like this!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Lead, inspire and motivate others to provide exceptional care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
