mbaexchange-guidepoint:greenhouse:846185.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recruitment Team &amp;amp; Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guidepoint’s Recruitment team is an integral part of a company that prides itself on identifying the most qualified person for the job. Our team focuses on maintaining integrity and promoting diversity, highlighting our dedication to creating an environment where every candidate is treated equitably, regardless of their background.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By utilizing innovative sourcing techniques, attending campus events, and expanding our brand presence, we attract and hire top talent from all over the world. The team consists of 35+ high-performing individuals from various backgrounds who work across 3 continents and 9 countries to make impactful hires for every department at Guidepoint.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled and strategic &lt;strong&gt;Senior Recruiter&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to manage and drive end-to-end hiring for our Tokyo office. This individual will play a critical role in building our talent pipeline, elevating our employer brand, and ensuring we attract, assess, and hire top-tier talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Day in Your New Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruitment for our Japan hirings across different departments, including sourcing, direct candidate outreach, interviewing, and offer management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute recruitment strategies aligned with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with hiring managers across multiple departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to forecast hiring needs, improve quality of hire, and drive a collaborative, consistent hiring process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data-driven recruitment practices and track key metrics (time to hire, offer acceptance rate, quality of hire, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Global TA team to standardize processes and share best practices across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Business, or related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 3+ years of experience in full-cycle recruiting, in-house or agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native fluency in Japanese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business level proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset: use of metrics (quality of hire, candidate experience, offer acceptance rate) to refine strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with ATS platforms (Greenhouse preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work cross-functionally and manage competing priorities in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central office location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial environment, autonomy, and fast decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT GUIDEPOINT:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guidepoint is a leading research enablement platform designed to advance understanding and empower our clients’ decision-making process. Powered by innovative technology, real-time data, and hard-to-source expertise, we help our clients to turn answers into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by a network of nearly 1.75 million experts, and Guidepoint’s 1,600 employees worldwide we inform leading organizations’ research by delivering on-demand intelligence and research on request. With Guidepoint, companies and investors can better navigate the abundance of information available today, making it both more useful and more powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Guidepoint, our success relies on the diversity of our employees, advisors, and client base, which allows us to create connections that offer a wealth of perspectives. We are committed to upholding policies that contribute to an equitable and welcoming environment for our community, regardless of background, identity, or experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CD1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

mbaexchange-guidepoint:greenhouse:847056.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Director, Strategic Partnerships to build and scale Guidepoint’s partnerships function, with an initial focus on distribution and platform partnerships across the research ecosystem. This is a hybrid role, based in NYC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will identify, structure, and execute partnerships that expand how Guidepoint’s content, research products, and intelligence solutions are accessed, embedded, and monetized. Over time, the mandate is expected to broaden to include product, AI, and strategic data licensing partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role at the intersection of product, commercial strategy, and corporate development. The ideal candidate will be equally comfortable shaping partnership strategy, negotiating complex deals, and working internally across product, sales, and leadership teams to bring partnerships to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distribution &amp;amp; Platform Partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute Guidepoint’s strategy for distribution and platform partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize external research platforms, marketplaces, workflow tools, and strategic partners where Guidepoint content or products can be distributed or embedded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure partnerships that expand the reach, usage, and monetization of Guidepoint’s Library and related intelligence products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate partnership opportunities across institutional investor, research, and enterprise workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Strategic Deal Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end partnership development including sourcing, evaluation, business case development, negotiation, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure commercial agreements and partnership models including distribution, co-branded offerings, embedded access, licensing, and other monetization frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build commercial frameworks that align partner incentives with Guidepoint’s strategic and revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal point of coordination for strategic partnership opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product, sales, legal, and senior leadership to bring partnerships from concept to launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define packaging, positioning, and operational requirements needed to support external partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure partnerships are structured in ways that are practical, scalable, and aligned with Guidepoint’s broader product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Future Expansion: Product, AI &amp;amp; Data Partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over time, help shape Guidepoint’s approach to product partnerships and emerging technology collaborations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate opportunities with AI-enabled research tools, data platforms, and other intelligence ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore opportunities to license or strategically monetize Guidepoint’s proprietary content and data assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of long-term partnership strategy as Guidepoint’s intelligence products evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear and prioritized strategic partnership roadmap aligned with Guidepoint’s growth strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution of high-impact distribution and platform partnerships that expand the reach and monetization of Guidepoint’s Library and intelligence products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong internal coordination across product, commercial, and leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scalable foundation for future product, technology, and data partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Landscaping: Strong understanding of the research, AI, and data ecosystem, including key platforms, emerging technologies, and competitive dynamics. Ability to map the value chain, identify relevant players, and prioritize partnership opportunities aligned with client needs and company strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Thinking: Ability to identify where partnerships create differentiated value for clients and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial Acumen: Strong judgment in evaluating deal economics, strategic tradeoffs, and long-term growth potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Influence: Skilled in structuring complex agreements and aligning multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Management: Ability to build and maintain strong relationships with external partners and internal teams to drive long-term partnership success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-12+ years of experience in strategic partnerships, business development, corporate development, or related commercial roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring and negotiating complex commercial partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of research platforms, information services, workflow tools, data products, or adjacent ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate both strategic and economic value of partnership opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally across product, commercial, and executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior expert network experience is not required, but familiarity with data-driven research businesses is helpful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary for this position is $180,000 - $200,000. Additionally, this position is eligible for a yearly bonus based on performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also be eligible for the following benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 PTO Days, 10 legal holidays, and sick days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical, dental, and vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Will match up to 10% of employee contribution for 401(k), life insurance, paid time-off and parental leave plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter benefits and corporate discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development opportunities through the LinkedIn Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friday happy hour, “Summer Fridays”, and free snacks and beverages in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Year-round corporate athletic league&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Casual work environment, team building, and other social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-WW1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base salary may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience, as well as geographic location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

