&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ils0h3&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;645&quot;&gt;Brings 5+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, cost accounting, operations finance, or supply chain finance, ideally within semiconductors, hardware, or manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
