&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fna1hu&quot; data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;Thrives in fast-moving environments and enjoys creating scalable processes from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
