&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strive Health is an equal opportunity employer and drug free workplace. At this time Strive Health is unable to provide work visa sponsorship. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Please apply even if you feel you do not meet all qualifications. If you require reasonable accommodation in completing this application, interviewing, completing any pre-employment testing, or otherwise participating in the employee selection process, please direct your inquiries to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talentacquisition@strivehealth.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;talentacquisition@strivehealth.com.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited resumes from outside recruiters/placement agencies. Strive Health will not pay fees associated with resumes presented through unsolicited means.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

nvp-banyan-software:greenhouse:513637100.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. We are on a mission to acquire, build, and grow great companies worldwide, helping them modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world. Banyan is Great Place to Work Certified, a five-time Inc. 5000 honoree, and a top 10 company on the Deloitte Technology Fast 500. Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Atlanta, Banyan operates more than 100 portfolio companies across North America, the UK, EU, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Host:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Host is building the future of hospitality technology.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re creating a modern, unified platform that brings together property management, payments, and the entire guest journey into one seamless system—replacing the fragmented, outdated tools that hotels have had to rely on for years. Our mission is simple: help hotels run better, move faster, and deliver exceptional guest experiences at every touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But what really sets Host apart is the stage we’re at.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing fast, solving real-world problems for leading hotel groups, and building technology that sits at the heart of how hospitality businesses operate every single day. This isn’t a maintenance role on a legacy system—this is an opportunity to shape a platform that is actively redefining an industry. We’re looking for exceptional people who care deeply about quality, ownership, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Host, you won’t get lost in layers of bureaucracy. You’ll have autonomy, responsibility, and the chance to make a visible difference from day one. We value people who think critically, move with urgency, and take pride in doing things properly. We’re building something ambitious and we’re looking for people who want to build it with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to work directly alongside the CEO of Host as a Chief of Staff, playing a key role in supporting the continued growth and development of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will gain broad exposure across all areas of the company, with a primary focus on driving value creation initiatives, supporting strategic priorities, and working closely with the CEO and wider leadership team. You will be involved in both day-to-day operations and longer-term strategic projects, helping to drive performance and execute on key business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will gain hands-on experience in scaling a software business, working across functions such as commercial, product, operations, and finance, and contributing to the overall growth journey of Host.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is well-suited to someone looking to accelerate their career, build a deep understanding of how to run and grow a software company, and develop the skills required to step into future leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For those who are motivated to learn, take ownership, and operate in a fast-paced, collaborative environment, this is a unique opportunity to work closely with an experienced CEO and make a meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the CEO and leadership team to drive key strategic and operational initiatives across Host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact, cross-functional projects spanning product, sales, marketing, and operations, acting as a right hand to the CEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the execution of key business priorities, helping to identify opportunities for growth, efficiency, and performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across teams to improve alignment, communication, and execution on critical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide analytical and operational support on decision-making, including preparing insights, tracking performance, and driving follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on experience in scaling a software business, building the foundation for future leadership roles within Host or the wider group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This program is designed for graduating (or recently graduated) students from top MBA programs. 1st year MBA students should not apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of prior experience in management consulting, private equity, investment banking, or an operational leadership role. A variety of prior relevant career experiences will be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to synthesize complex information and drive data-informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to influence and collaborate effectively at all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading projects, managing competing priorities, and delivering results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for learning and growth, with a long-term goal of stepping into an executive leadership position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan: Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Global Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. As a collective, our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banyan Software may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to assist in screening and/or assessing applicants during the recruitment process. All hiring decisions are made by our team. Personal information submitted through your application will be collected and used for recruitment purposes in accordance with applicable privacy laws. Contact us at any time with questions about our process or to request accommodation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an &lt;strong&gt;@banyansoftware.com&lt;/strong&gt; email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@banyansoftware.com&quot;&gt;careers@banyansoftware.com&lt;/a&gt; and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

