&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is seeking a&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Director, Business Development to join our U.S.-based Growth team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a U.S. hybrid role, based in or near one of our U.S. hubs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role partners closely with executive leadership, client leads, and&amp;nbsp;crossfunctional&amp;nbsp;capability teams to lead&amp;nbsp;highimpact&amp;nbsp;pitches, expand strategic accounts, and strengthen Real Chemistry’s overall business development approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into senior growth leadership, this role serves as a connector across markets, capabilities, and teams—bringing structure, strategic rigor, and storytelling excellence to the pursuit process while ensuring opportunities are positioned in a differentiated,&amp;nbsp;clientcentric&amp;nbsp;way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
